# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Sode no Shirayuki — environment configuration
# Copy to `.env` (local dev) or set in Vercel:
#   Project Settings → Environment Variables
# Only ONE variable is required: API_BASE_URL. Everything else has a default.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Upstream scraper — the live Ruby API scraping hianime.at.
# NOTE: No trailing slash. The client prepends "/api/v2/..." so a trailing
# slash would create "//" and trigger a 308 redirect on every request.
# ⚠ The old shirayuki-scrapper-api-v2.vercel.app domain is DISABLED and must
#   never be referenced again; if API_BASE_URL is missing, clients fall back
#   to a hardcoded default (also the Ruby API) — not the dead domain.
API_BASE_URL=https://shirayuki-anime-api-ruby.vercel.app
